{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50752","headline":"惠尼童子 · 张祜","name":"惠尼童子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"慢眉童子语惺惺，实爲天主自有灵。\n（「主」，严疑「生」之误。\n）可惜绿丝梳黛髻，枉将纤手把铜瓶。\n低回綩态传师教，更学吴音诵梵经。\n不似俗家诸姊妹，朝朝画得两蛾青。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50752.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50752","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}